<title>UK: Chelsea Village placing shares at 140p.</title>
<headline>Chelsea Village placing shares at 140p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>English football club holding company Chelsea Village Plc said on Monday it was placing 1.1 million new ordinary shares at a price of 140p each.  </p>
<p>Chelsea's shares were marked up 3.5p at 157.5 by 0825 GMT.</p>
<p>Chelsea said its brokers, Ellis and Partners Ltd, were being paid a fee of 2.0 percent of the sums raised.</p>
<p>Settlement and issue of the shares was intended for February 17, Chelsea said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
